#~ "`agent_local_password_logins` into sign-in "
#~ "identities (email, login name, phone) "
#~ "and optional password credentials, carrying"
#~ " every account over with its "
#~ "verification time and hash; adds the "
#~ "access view every SQL gate reads, "
#~ "the `deleted` account state, phone "
#~ "codes, browser sessions, sign-in events,"
#~ " the signup domain list and first-"
